WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:06.000
Two days before pickup, I needed to change the date.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:07.238
Calls.

00:00:07.238 --> 00:00:07.726
Texts.

00:00:07.726 --> 00:00:08.622
Voicemails.

00:00:08.622 --> 00:00:09.598
All weekend.

00:00:09.598 --> 00:00:10.900
Nobody answered.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.225
Then.

00:00:13.575 --> 00:00:15.925
Them: Your deposit is gone.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.640
Put every request in writing.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.059
Pay deposits by card.

00:00:20.059 --> 00:00:22.830
If they won't answer, you can dispute it.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.566
Keep your own record.

00:00:25.566 --> 00:00:26.913
packedrabbit.com.

00:00:26.913 --> 00:00:31.505
If this helped, like it, share it with someone who's moving, and subscribe.
